  "page": "page-04",
  "idea": "Krita: free open-source digital painting and graphics tool",
  "text": "The community-driven graphics app packed with professional brushes and layer tools. Digital creators waste hours fighting browser design tools that stutter under high-resolution canvases and complex layer hierarchies. Lightweight drawing apps lack brush smoothing engines, transform tools, and non-destructive adjustment masks for serious work. Krita provides over one hundred customizable brushes, hand-jitter stabilizers, vector paths, and complete color management without restrictions. You craft professional digital artwork without expensive commercial licenses.",
